        "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/42e082209fa5db357eaf6d63cdce02e0.avif?t=1789059887\" width=964 height=1604 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a country. Decide what happens to the world. Warnament is an approachable turn-based grand strategy sandbox about conquest, diplomacy and creating your own history. Play solo or bring friends into the struggle for power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change history through diplomacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Declare wars, negotiate peace, and build pacts and alliances. Guarantee an ally's independence, demand concessions, force a rival into vassalage, or send an insult when diplomacy takes a personal turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade resources to build your wealth, impose sanctions to put pressure on opponents, and call your allies into a conflict when you need their support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/4a91b919633f83a571bee828e897646c.poster.avif?t=1789059887\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/4a91b919633f83a571bee828e897646c.webm?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/4a91b919633f83a571bee828e897646c.mp4?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for every border</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise armies, build fleets and fortify your provinces. Command forces ranging from infantry to cruisers, battleships and aircraft carriers, and develop weapons as powerful as nuclear bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your borders with fortresses and defensive infrastructure, or escalate the conflict with chemical and nuclear weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/1e43b36246d01be9e725c6c63e8bb565.poster.avif?t=1789059887\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/1e43b36246d01be9e725c6c63e8bb565.webm?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/1e43b36246d01be9e725c6c63e8bb565.mp4?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the power behind your nation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your economy and progress through the technology tree to unlock buildings and structures. Manage provinces individually to support economic and scientific growth and prepare for your next campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six political regimes and make decisions that can change your country's course. Decide when to invest in development and when to commit your resources to war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/9770b1ab1eb46f6b40682630c83feab5.poster.avif?t=1789059887\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/9770b1ab1eb46f6b40682630c83feab5.webm?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/9770b1ab1eb46f6b40682630c83feab5.mp4?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make and share your own history</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create maps and scenarios with the editors, then retell your campaign with the timelapse editor. Start from history or invent a world with its own countries and conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download community mods through Steam Workshop or publish your own. Change buildings, resources, technologies, events and political decisions to make Warnament yours. Share your creations with other players; outstanding community content may even become part of the official game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/af6640742c00e173f587b6ee24bbb5e9.poster.avif?t=1789059887\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/af6640742c00e173f587b6ee24bbb5e9.webm?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/af6640742c00e173f587b6ee24bbb5e9.mp4?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a country. Decide what happens to the world. Warnament is an approachable turn-based grand strategy sandbox about conquest, diplomacy and creating your own history. Play solo or bring friends into the struggle for power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change history through diplomacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Declare wars, negotiate peace, and build pacts and alliances. Guarantee an ally's independence, demand concessions, force a rival into vassalage, or send an insult when diplomacy takes a personal turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade resources to build your wealth, impose sanctions to put pressure on opponents, and call your allies into a conflict when you need their support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/4a91b919633f83a571bee828e897646c.poster.avif?t=1789059887\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/4a91b919633f83a571bee828e897646c.webm?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/4a91b919633f83a571bee828e897646c.mp4?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for every border</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise armies, build fleets and fortify your provinces. Command forces ranging from infantry to cruisers, battleships and aircraft carriers, and develop weapons as powerful as nuclear bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your borders with fortresses and defensive infrastructure, or escalate the conflict with chemical and nuclear weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/1e43b36246d01be9e725c6c63e8bb565.poster.avif?t=1789059887\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/1e43b36246d01be9e725c6c63e8bb565.webm?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/1e43b36246d01be9e725c6c63e8bb565.mp4?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the power behind your nation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your economy and progress through the technology tree to unlock buildings and structures. Manage provinces individually to support economic and scientific growth and prepare for your next campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six political regimes and make decisions that can change your country's course. Decide when to invest in development and when to commit your resources to war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/9770b1ab1eb46f6b40682630c83feab5.poster.avif?t=1789059887\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/9770b1ab1eb46f6b40682630c83feab5.webm?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/9770b1ab1eb46f6b40682630c83feab5.mp4?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make and share your own history</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create maps and scenarios with the editors, then retell your campaign with the timelapse editor. Start from history or invent a world with its own countries and conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download community mods through Steam Workshop or publish your own. Change buildings, resources, technologies, events and political decisions to make Warnament yours. Share your creations with other players; outstanding community content may even become part of the official game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/af6640742c00e173f587b6ee24bbb5e9.poster.avif?t=1789059887\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/af6640742c00e173f587b6ee24bbb5e9.webm?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201700/extras/af6640742c00e173f587b6ee24bbb5e9.mp4?t=1789059887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
